        "title": "Calculate f(x+h) - f(x)",
        "text": "Subtract $f(x)$ from $f(x+h)$:\n\n$f(x+h) - f(x)$\n\n$= (x^2 + 2xh + h^2 - 4x - 4h + 3) - (x^2 - 4x + 3)$\n\n$= x^2 + 2xh + h^2 - 4x - 4h + 3 - x^2 + 4x - 3$\n\n$= 2xh + h^2 - 4h$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "Siyavula Grade 12 Mathematics",
