    },
    {
        "id": "calc-diff-010b-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": ["calc-diff-010b-h1"],
        "title": "Divide by h and Factor",
        "text": "Divide by $h$ and factor:\n\n$\\frac{f(x+h) - f(x)}{h} = \\frac{2xh + h^2 - 4h}{h}$\n\nFactor out $h$ from the numerator:\n\n$= \\frac{h(2x + h - 4)}{h} = 2x + h - 4$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "Siyavula Grade 12 Mathematics",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0"
    },
    {
        "id": "calc-diff-010b-h3",
